      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:28:24 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;#39;ve written a natural-language exposition of Alpöge&amp;#39;s Lean proof of the Riemann Hypothesis: 684 pages covering the whole argument, with a table mapping 125 statements to the Lean declarations that formalize them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prepared with heavy use of Claude; not refereed. Corrections very welcome.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/arhamzahid235711/alpoge-rh-exposition" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;github.com/arhamzahid235711/al&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;poge-rh-exposition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mathstodon.xyz/tags/RiemannHypothesis" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;RiemannHypothesis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href="https://mathstodon.xyz/tags/numbertheory" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;numbertheory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href="https://mathstodon.xyz/tags/leanprover" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;leanprover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
